entityDescription:
Skycomm is an innovative company with the aim of rethinking access to space telecommunications;
Skycomm is a selected skilled team of experts among the aviation and satellite telecommunications sector, with over 35 years of experience in design and production of satcom on the move antennas.
Skycomm is developing the first experimental LEO satellite in QV band for ultra-wide band 5G satellite internet communications implementing its proven experience in avionics, land and sea mobile terminals.

